  "description": "Conversion of an existing dwelling (Class C3) to a hybrid C3/C1 use (Sui Generis).",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-5e638cd1-7fff-f3d3-b8dc-5b9b5902eac0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposed development would result in the effective loss of a permanent residential unit (Class C3), reducing the borough’s long-term housing supply. The proposal fails to demonstrate that continued C3 use is unviable and would undermine Hackney’s ability to meet identified housing needs. The development is therefore contrary to policies H8 (Loss of existing housing and estate redevelopment) and H9 (Ensuring the best use of stock) of the London Plan (2021) and policies LP12 (Housing Supply), LP24 (Loss of Housing), and LP25 (Visitor Accommodation) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (LP33).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-c792f139-7fff-3c4e-224d-52fe91a5f552&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposed development would result in increased noise and disturbance associated with frequent guest turnover and servicing activity. This would be detrimental to the living conditions of neighbouring occupiers and harmful to the established residential character of the building. The proposal is contrary to policy D14 (Noise) of the London Plan (2021) and policies LP2 (Development and Amenity) and LP58 (Managing Impacts of Development) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (LP33) (2020).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
